{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everlords is a strategy game where you don\u2019t just play on the battlefield\u2014you create it.</strong> Shape the land itself, place vital resources, and fortify your base as you fight to reclaim the Ashen Lands. Every decision lays the groundwork for your triumph\u2014or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Harness the powers of demi-gods to bend the world to your will: sculpt terrain, carve choke points, reserve space for growing settlements, and channel Ether to amplify your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But creation comes with risk. The choices you make may just as easily summon new threats and unforeseen challenges as they do opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.poster.avif?t=1771067707\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.webm?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.mp4?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.poster.avif?t=1771067707\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.webm?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.mp4?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.poster.avif?t=1771067707\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.webm?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.mp4?t=1771067707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World-Shaping Strategy</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t just adapt to the map\u2014craft it. Raise mountains, carve rivers, and reshape terrain to control the flow of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Resource Placement</strong> \u2013 Decide where strategic resources appear, balancing risk and reward as you fuel expansion and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Settlements</strong> \u2013 Leave space for towns and outposts to grow, influencing the economy, defenses, and long-term survival of your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demi-God Powers</strong> \u2013 Harness divine abilities to alter the battlefield in dramatic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Outcomes</strong> \u2013 Your creations may also spawn unforeseen threats, forcing you to adapt as the world pushes back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability by Design</strong> \u2013 Each run unfolds differently, with new maps, powers, and challenges ensuring no two playthroughs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Fortify your stronghold against waves of enemies, using terrain manipulation as your ultimate weapon.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2818380?t=1771067707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771067707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771067707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771067707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Killing enemies"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everlords is a strategy game where you don\u2019t just play on the battlefield\u2014you create it.</strong> Shape the land itself, place vital resources, and fortify your base as you fight to reclaim the Ashen Lands. Every decision lays the groundwork for your triumph\u2014or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same. Harness the powers of demi-gods to bend the world to your will: sculpt terrain, carve choke points, reserve space for growing settlements, and channel Ether to amplify your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But creation comes with risk. The choices you make may just as easily summon new threats and unforeseen challenges as they do opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.p