\u2014craft it. Raise mountains, carve rivers, and reshape terrain to control the flow of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Resource Placement</strong> \u2013 Decide where strategic resources appear, balancing risk and reward as you fuel expansion and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living Settlements</strong> \u2013 Leave space for towns and outposts to grow, influencing the economy, defenses, and long-term survival of your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demi-God Powers</strong> \u2013 Harness divine abilities to alter the battlefield in dramatic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Outcomes</strong> \u2013 Your creations may also spawn unforeseen threats, forcing you to adapt as the world pushes back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability by Design</strong> \u2013 Each run unfolds differently, with new maps, powers, and challenges ensuring no two playthroughs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Fortify your stronghold against waves of enemies, using terrain manipulation as your ultimate weapon.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Flox Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/header.jpg?t=1771067707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2818380/718853/6aa22d276ad4b1538dbde563139ba5536ab6ba5c/17